#. ja: 対象を討伐
#. de: Besiege die Gegner
#. fr: Vaincre les cibles
msgctxt "LeveString:1:0:0"
msgid "Defeat target enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 目標物を入手
#. de: Besorge die Gegenstände
#. fr: Récupérer les objets désignés
msgctxt "LeveString:2:0:0"
msgid "Obtain target items."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 対象をせん滅
#. de: Vernichte alle Gegner
#. fr: Éliminer les cibles
msgctxt "LeveString:3:0:0"
msgid "Eliminate target enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 対象を追撃して倒せ
#. de: Verfolge und vernichte alle Gegner
#. fr: Traquer et éliminer les cibles
msgctxt "LeveString:4:0:0"
msgid "Pursue and defeat target enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 対象を弱らせて<br><if ($n1 == 0)>エモート「なだめる」<else><sheet EventItem $n1 0></if>を使って手懐けろ
#. de: Schwäche den Gegner und besänftige ihn <if ($n1 == 0)>mit dem Emote „Beruhigen“<else>mit <noun-de EventItem 5 $n1 2 3 1></if>
#. fr: Affaiblir la cible puis la calmer avec <if ($n1 == 0)>l'emote /apaiser<else><noun-fr EventItem 2 $n1 1 1></if>
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 0)>the /soothe emote<else><noun-en EventItem 2 $n1 1 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:5:0:0"
msgid "Weaken target and then pacify it using <if ($n1 == 0)>the /soothe emote<else><noun-en EventItem 2 $n1 1 1></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($n1 == 0)>対象を攻撃し<else><sheet EventItem $n1 0>を使用し</if><br>正体を見破って討伐せよ
#. de: <if ($n1 == 0)>Greif an<else>Benutze <noun-de EventItem 5 $n1 2 4 1></if>, um die Gegner zu enttarnen, und besiege sie
#. fr: <if ($n1 == 0)>Attaquer la cible<else>Utiliser <noun-fr EventItem 1 $n1 1 1></if> pour révéler la véritable forme de la cible, puis la vaincre
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 0)>Attack target to reveal its<else>Use <noun-en EventItem 1 $n1 1 1> to reveal target's</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:6:0:0"
msgid "<if ($n1 == 0)>Attack target to reveal its<else>Use <noun-en EventItem 1 $n1 1 1> to reveal target's</if> true form, then defeat it."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 所定の地点を巡り、敵を撃退せよ
#. de: Beseitige die Gegner im Zielgebiet
#. fr: Vaincre toutes les cibles dans les zones désignées
msgctxt "LeveString:7:0:0"
msgid "Defeat all targets in the locations specified."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「妖異全集」の紙片を回収し<br>封じられた魔物を召喚して倒せ
#. de: Sammle die Seiten des „Nekrologs“ und besiege das daraus erscheinende Monster
#. fr: Réunir les pages du Nécrologos et vaincre la créature invoquée
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "LeveString:8:0:0"
msgid "Gather all missing pages of the <i>Necrologos</i> and defeat the creature summoned from within."
msgstr ""

#. ja: エモート「手まねきする」を使って<br><sheet BNpcName $n1 0>を目的地まで導け
#. de: Geleite <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 4 1> zum Ziel
#. fr: Utiliser l'emote <i>/viens</i> (Inviter) pour mener <noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> en lieu sûr
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:9:0:0"
msgid "Use the /beckon emote to lead <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> safely to the specified location."
msgstr ""

#. ja: すべての目標地点を採集しつくせ<br>評価値により報酬ボーナス：<br>320以上　+25%<br>303以上　+10%<br>286以上　+05%
#. de: Sammle die Gegenstände in allen Zielgebieten<br>Bonus für Bewertung von<br>min. 320: +25 %<br>min. 303: +10 %<br>min. 286: +5 %
#. fr: Récolter aux endroits désignés<br>Bonus de récompense selon l'évaluation<nbsp>:<br>286 ou plus<nbsp>: +   5%<br>303 ou plus<nbsp>: + 10%<br>320 ou plus<nbsp>: + 25%
