#. ja: 出現する魔物を倒して<br>「妖異全集」の紙片を回収し<br>封じられた魔物を召喚して倒せ
#. de: Sammle die Seiten des „Nekrologs“ und besiege das daraus erscheinende Monster
#. fr: Réunir les pages du Nécrologos en terrassant les ennemis et vaincre la créature invoquée
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "LeveString:20:0:0"
msgid "Gather all missing pages of the <i>Necrologos</i> and defeat the creature summoned from within."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 進捗率
#. de: Fortschritt
#. fr: Progression 
msgctxt "LeveString:21:0:0"
msgid "Progress"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 巡回した目的地
#. de: Abgesuchte Gebiete
#. fr: Zones sécurisées 
msgctxt "LeveString:22:0:0"
msgid "Locations visited"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 弱らせずに懐柔を試みると<br>対象が興奮状態に陥るため注意せよ<br>懐柔対象を倒すと任務失敗
#. de: Schwäche das Ziel vorm Besänftigen, aber schlag es nicht k. o. 
#. fr: Les cibles se mettront en colère si vous tentez de les apaiser trop tôt<br>(Le mandat échoue si les cibles sont tuées)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "LeveString:23:0:0"
msgid "Targets will grow frenzied if pacification is attempted too early.<br>Levequest deemed a failure if targets accidentally killed."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>を倒すと手に入る<br><sheet EventItem $n2 0>を使用し<br>魔物の正体を見破れ
#. de: Ringe <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 2 3 1> <noun-de EventItem 5 $n2 2 4 1> ab, um Monster zu enttarnen
#. fr: Vaincre des <noun-fr BNpcName 12 $n1 2 1> pour obtenir des <noun-fr EventItem 12 $n2 2 1>
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 1 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 1 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 1, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:24:0:0"
msgid "Defeat <noun-en BNpcName 1 $n1 2 1> to obtain glamour-dispelling <noun-en EventItem 1 $n2 2 1>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>が倒されると任務失敗
#. de: Wenn <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1 1> k. o. geht, scheitert die Mission
#. fr: Le mandat échoue à la mort <noun-fr BNpcName 9 $n1 1 1>
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:25:0:0"
msgid "Levequest deemed a failure if <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> is slain."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 対象を守りつつ敵を撃退せよ
#. de: Beschütze das Missionsobjekt und besiege die Gegner
#. fr: Protéger l'objet de la mission et vaincre les ennemis
msgctxt "LeveString:26:0:0"
msgid "Defeat the enemies while protecting your charge."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 制限時間内に、より多くの敵を倒せ
#. de: Besiege so viele Gegner wie möglich
#. fr: Vaincre autant d'ennemis que possible dans le temps imparti
msgctxt "LeveString:27:0:0"
msgid "Defeat as many enemies as possible within the allotted time."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EventItem $n1 0>の保有者を発見し<br>正体を見破って倒せ
#. de: Finde den Gegner mit <noun-de EventItem 5 $n1 2 3 1> und besiege ihn
#. fr: Découvrir l'ennemi qui possède <noun-fr EventItem 2 $n1 2 1> et le vaincre
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 2 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:28:0:0"
msgid "Discover who is carrying <noun-en EventItem 2 $n1 2 1> and slay the target."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 増援を呼び出す敵を倒せ
#. de: Besiege die Gegner, die Verstärkung rufen
#. fr: Abattre l'ennemi qui appelle des renforts
msgctxt "LeveString:30:0:0"
msgid "Defeat any enemies summoning reinforcements."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 失敗条件：目標討伐数に達しない
#. de: Bei zu wenig besiegten Gegnern scheitert die Mission
#. fr: Le mandat échoue si trop peu d'ennemis sont éliminés
msgctxt "LeveString:31:0:0"
msgid "Objective failed if insufficient number of enemies slain."
msgstr ""

#. ja: エモート「<if ($n1 == 1)>つつく<else>問い詰める</if>」に反応した敵を倒し<br><sheet EventItem $n2 0>を入手せよ
#. de: Besiege Gegner, die auf das <if ($n1 == 1)>/stups<else>/schuld</if> Emote reagieren und sammle <noun-de EventItem 2 $n2 2 4 1> auf.
#. fr: Éliminer les ennemis qui répondent à l'emote <if ($n1 == 1)>/toucher<else>/questionner</if> et récupérer <noun-fr EventItem 1 $n2 2 1>
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>/poke<else>/doubt</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 1 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 1, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:32:0:0"
msgid "Slay enemies that respond to the <if ($n1 == 1)>/poke<else>/doubt</if> emote and collect <noun-en EventItem 1 $n2 2 1>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 失敗条件：<sheet BNpcName $n1 0>が全て失われる
#. de: Mission misslingt, wenn alle <noun-de BNpcName 5 $n1 2 1 1> verloren gehen
#. fr: Le mandat échoue si <if "<sheet BNpcName $n1 6>">toutes<else>tous</if> <noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n1 2 1> sont <if "<sheet BNpcName $n1 6>">perdues<else>perdus</if>
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 1 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:33:0:0"
msgid "Objective failed if all <noun-en BNpcName 1 $n1 2 1> are lost."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>から手に入る<br><sheet EventItem $n2 0>を<sheet EObj $n3 0>に使用し<br><sheet BNpcName $n4 0>を誘い出せ
#. de: Benutze <noun-de EventItem 2 $n2 2 4 1> von <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 2 3 1> an <noun-de EObj 2 $n3 2 3 1>, um <noun-de BNpcName 5 $n4 2 4 1> anzulocken
#. fr: Obtenir <noun-fr EventItem 1 $n2 1 1> sur <noun-fr BNpcName 1 $n1 1 1> et l'utiliser sur <noun-fr EObj 1 $n3 1 1> pour attirer <noun-fr BNpcName 1 $n4 1 1>
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en EObj 3 $n3 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EObj, form = 3, row = number parameter 3, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n4 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 3, row = number parameter 4, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LeveString:34:0:0"
msgid "Use <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> obtained from <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n1 2 1> on <noun-en EObj 3 $n3 2 1> to lure out <noun-en BNpcName 3 $n4 2 1>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 弱らせずに懐柔を試みると<br>対象が興奮状態に陥るため注意せよ
#. de: Schwäche das Ziel vor dem Besänftigen, sonst rastet es aus
#. fr: Les cibles se mettront en colère si vous tentez de les apaiser trop tôt
msgctxt "LeveString:35:0:0"
msgid "Targets will grow frenzied if pacification is attempted too early."
msgstr ""
